# 🎯 How to Use This Repository

1. Select a category based on your current learning level.
2. Choose one primary YouTube channel for each subject.
3. Follow complete playlists instead of random videos.
4. Practice coding while watching tutorials.
5. Build real-world projects.
6. Document your projects on GitHub.
7. Learn system design after developing programming and backend fundamentals.
8. Practice explaining your technical decisions.

**Important:** Watching tutorials alone will not make you an engineer. Focus on implementation, debugging, architecture, and real-world problem solving.

